I am pretty new to R, and I am trying to use the filterRecordTable() function with some pre-existing data in an Excel sheet. I keep running into an error with the recordDateTimeCol

TES21_SpatialTag1and2 is the csv that I am working with, and I am trying to filter for temporal independence with 30 minutes between records.

Here is the code that I am running.

TES21_SpatialFiltered<-filterRecordTable(recordTable = "TES21_SpatialTag1and2",

                  minDeltaTime = 30,
                  deltaTimeComparedTo = "lastIndependentRecord"

